      "title": {
        "en": "Friendly staff with mixed communication"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many customers praise the grooming team for being courteous, attentive, and welcoming during regular visits in The Hammocks. Long-time clients often highlight accommodating customer care. However, several dissatisfied pet owners report unprofessional interactions with management when raising concerns about haircuts, leading to divided impressions regarding front-desk communication."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Neat trims alongside uneven cuts"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Most pet parents are satisfied with the grooming outcomes, noting that their dogs leave looking neat, well-brushed, and smelling fresh after baths and styling. At the same time, a few owners express frustration over uneven ear trims, missed de-matting, or close shaving that differed from what was requested, creating varied feedback on haircut consistency."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 7,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle care for sensitive pups"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Dog owners consistently highlight that groomers treat pets gently, keeping visits relatively low-stress for nervous or energetic dogs. Several reviewers specifically commend the staff for their patient approach with older dogs and fidgety pups during brushing. Clients appreciate picking up calm, comfortable animals after grooming sessions."
      }
    }
  ],
